      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al principio de todo no había luz del día. El mundo estaba a oscuras.",
          "en": "At the beginning of things, there was no daylight. The world lay in darkness."
        },
        {
          "es": "Río Nass arriba vivía un hombre rico. Guardaba toda la luz del mundo para él solo.",
          "en": "Far up the Nass River lived a rich man. He kept all the light in the world for himself."
        },
        {
          "es": "En las paredes de su casa colgaban bultos redondos. En ellos guardaba las estrellas y la luna.",
          "en": "Round bundles hung on the walls of his house. In them, he kept the stars and the moon."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y en una caja guardaba la luz del día.",
          "en": "And in a box, he kept the daylight."
        }
      ],
